<?php $title='Privacy Policy';$body='<h2>Information we collect</h2><p>When operational, the store may collect contact details (name, email, phone), shipping address, order details, and customer support messages that you provide.</p><h2>Payment processing</h2><p>Payments are intended to be processed by PayPal. We do not intend to collect or store raw payment card details. The payment provider handles payment data under its own privacy terms.</p><h2>Cookies and analytics</h2><p>Session cookies support the shopping cart and security. Analytics are not configured in this demo. Any analytics or advertising tools must be disclosed here before activation.</p><h2>Service providers and security</h2><p>Hosting, payment, email, shipping, and analytics providers may process data needed to deliver their services. We use reasonable safeguards but no internet transmission or storage system can be guaranteed secure.</p><h2>Retention and choices</h2><p>Order and tax records may be retained as required for business operations and legal obligations. Contact us to ask about access, correction, or deletion of information, subject to applicable requirements.</p><h2>Contact</h2><p>info@iphonedeals.online</p>';require __DIR__.'/legal-page.php';
